---
---
<!-- EDUCATION SECTION -->
<section id="education" class="reveal-section content-section px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 py-20 border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
                <span class="section-index">02 · Riwayat</span>
                <h2>Pendidikan &amp; Pengalaman</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Perjalanan akademik dan aktivitas kampus saya di bidang teknologi.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline academic-timeline">
            <article class="timeline-item timeline-item-current">
                <div class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-card-heading">
                        <span class="timeline-icon"><i data-lucide="graduation-cap" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                        <span class="timeline-period">2025 - Sekarang</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="timeline-label">Pendidikan tinggi · S1</span>
                    <h3>Teknik Informatika</h3>
                    <p class="timeline-school">STT Terpadu Nurul Fikri</p>
                    <span class="timeline-tag"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Sedang ditempuh</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-card-heading">
                        <span class="timeline-icon timeline-icon-secondary"><i data-lucide="calculator" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                        <span class="timeline-period">2022 - 2025</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="timeline-label">Pendidikan menengah · Keahlian</span>
                    <h3>Akuntansi dan Keuangan Lembaga</h3>
                    <p class="timeline-school">SMK Amaliyah Jakarta</p>
                    <p>Mempelajari pencatatan transaksi, penyusunan laporan keuangan, administrasi, dan pengelolaan dokumen keuangan lembaga.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-card-heading">
                        <span class="timeline-icon"><i data-lucide="users" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                        <span class="timeline-period">2026 - Sekarang</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="timeline-label">Organisasi mahasiswa</span>
                    <h3>HIMA TI</h3>
                    <p class="timeline-school">Himpunan Mahasiswa Teknik Informatika</p>
                    <p>Wadah mahasiswa untuk mengembangkan kompetensi di bidang informatika, berbagi wawasan, dan membangun kolaborasi melalui kegiatan akademik maupun kemahasiswaan di STT Terpadu Nurul Fikri.</p>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
